[ZOOKEEPER-3635](<a href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZOOKEEPER-3635" rel="nofollow">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZOOKEEPER-3635</a>) changed the versioning scheme for the C client from integer-valued `ZOO_{MAJOR,MINOR,PATCH}_VERSION` definitions to a single string-valued `#define ZOO_VERSION "3.6.0"`.

This caused the Perl and Python contribs to fail to build.  The attached patches should repair the issue.

eolivelli, nkalmar: What do you think?

