We wish to fix this long-standing issue in the code.
Note that the previous commit processor algorithm had the same approach (as the one suggested in this fix) when dealing with a request that has a different cxid than session's expected one (see [here](<a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/commit/9fc632c4f0a340b0a00ec6dff39c7b454c802822#diff-5cc688a027068714af01b0ad4d292fe5L238"><tt>9fc632c</tt>#diff-5cc688a027068714af01b0ad4d292fe5L238</a>)).

This fix is based on the code from <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="206683108" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/issues/167" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/zookeeper/pull/167/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/pull/167">#167</a>, following the discussion in <a href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZOOKEEPER-2684" rel="nofollow">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZOOKEEPER-2684</a> .

