This check might not always hold because the nominated leader could fail to lead the quorum during sync phase - for example if sync time out [when waiting for quorum ack](<a href="https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/blob/master/src/java/main/org/apache/zookeeper/server/quorum/Leader.java#L1232">https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/blob/master/src/java/main/org/apache/zookeeper/server/quorum/Leader.java#L1232</a>). I am thinking we should just remove this instead of fixing it because the nominated leader is not an interface level contract / guarantee but a best effort / implementation level details.

